From: Quintin Smits <qd.smits@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 13:43:48 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 06/22] fix(app): refuse a tangent lead radius at or under the
 kerf offset at the command door

The wire gate reads the arc lead radius against the resolved condition's
kerf offset (wire radius + spark gap) when an operation is made, edited
or given a new tool. The generator keeps its own check for a loaded file
or a changed condition. Review finding 1 on #4002.

Refs #3991

