+| `tnc620-81760x` | TNC 620 81760x-01 … -18 | yes | 4 | yes | yes | q395 | q208 (q373 from -16) | none | presetTable | cycle9 (-01..-03), functionDwell (-04 on) | plane (SYM -06 on) | FUNCTION TCPM / M128 (-01..-06), FUNCTION TCPM (-07 on) | helixLin -16; PRESET SELECT -08; option 19 as above |
+| `tnc640-a` | TNC 640 34059x-01 / -02 | yes | 4 | yes (32 chars from -02) | yes | q211 | q379 | none | presetTable | cycle9 | plane | FUNCTION TCPM / M128 | |
